30,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"We are billed by area, not headcount, and re-running power costs 6,200 yen per desk every time we change.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The printer area is much noisier, and the physio says it takes days to get a workstation setting right.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,May,,"Setting up daily takes up to nine minutes, and past unplanned shuffles caused weeks of interruptions.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Daylight is a major complaint, and arrival times vary wildly, meaning first-come systems are biased.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Proximity helped project communication and helped new joiners learn the unwritten rules of our work.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@May, if shuffles are that disruptive, we should avoid any plan that requires frequent movement.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, if we move often, I'll never get my chair and monitor adjusted comfortably.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, I agree. But @Daisuke, your point about learning through overhearing is interesting.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, that's great, but we can't ignore that some seats are objectively worse than others.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, I understand. I just don't want us to become isolated from each other.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"Given the costs, a permanent setup seems most fiscally responsible.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Minato,,I strongly prefer something where I can keep my settings and avoid the noise.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,May,,I can't support anything that adds a daily setup tax to my morning.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If we go permanent, we have to address the window issue and the ""bad"" seats.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,Maybe there is a way to get the social benefits without the daily chaos.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
